## 2. FUNCTIONAL SYSTEM SPECIFICATIONS

### Module 1: Multi-Currency Core Ledger & Client Apps (iOS, Android, Web)
* **Tiered Identity & AML Onboarding:** Automated Tier 1 to 3 KYC verification engine (BVN/NIN for Nigeria, Ghana Card, International Passport, biometric liveness detection, and global PEP/Sanctions watchlists via Smile ID or Dojah).
* **Multi-Currency Wallets:** Distinct sub-accounts for primary West African currencies (NGN, GHS, XOF) alongside a hybrid custodial USDT (TRC20, ERC20, Polygon) wallet.
* **On-Ramp & Off-Ramp (Local Fiat In/Out):**
  * Automated Dedicated Virtual Accounts (DVA) for instant bank transfer deposits.
  * Local bank transfers and Mobile Money (MoMo: MTN, Telecel, Orange) payouts across Ghana and Francophone West Africa.
* **Automated Instant Swaps (Fiat to Crypto to Fiat):** Real-time FX quote engine calculating cross-currency rates with configurable platform spread margins (e.g., 0.5% to 1.5% markup).
* **Cross-Border P2P & Business Transfers:** Near-instant settlement between users in different West African corridors bypassing traditional multi-day correspondent banking delays.
* **Virtual Multi-Currency Cards:** Instant issuance of USD and NGN virtual Mastercard/Visa for cross-border digital merchant checkout, funded directly from fiat or USDT balances.
* **Automated Value-Added Services (VAS):** Airtime, cross-border mobile data bundles, power utilities, and bill settlement across operating territories.

### Module 2: Core Institutional Engine & Liquidity Treasury
* **Double-Entry Settlement Engine:** Transaction isolation, ledger consistency, and automated reserve accounting to eliminate ledger drift or phantom balances.
* **Automated OTC Liquidity Rebalancing:** Webhook-driven auto-swaps via institutional OTC endpoints to hedge currency volatility when users pay in crypto and withdraw in local fiat.
* **MPC Custodial Architecture:** Enterprise-grade key management splitting transaction signing across distinct nodes, preventing unauthorized single-point asset drain.

### Module 3: Master Admin, Compliance & Treasury Console
* **Automated Transaction Monitoring (STR/SAR):** Velocity limits, suspicious pattern alerts, blacklisted blockchain address screening (Chainalysis / Elliptic API bridge), and sanctions tracking.
* **Treasury & Liquidity Management:** Real-time visibility into float balances across partner banks, OTC accounts, and on-chain liquidity pools.
* **FX Spread & Fee Matrix:** Dynamic configuration of swap spreads, network gas fees, card issuance margins, and international payout fees.
* **Audit, Tax & Regulatory Reporting:** Automated export of daily transaction logs and compliance audit trails formatted for central bank and regulatory inspection.

